istent with the sentinel lymph node dye procedure  Representative sections are taken as follows  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Medial margin  en face   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lateral margin  en face   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative radial section from inferior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative radial section from superior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of fibrous breast parenchyma located 4 0cm from medial margin and 4 0cm from inferior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of areola and adjacent anterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Radial section to posterior margin deep to the areola   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Radial section to anterior margin located 3 0cm from the lateral margin and 3 0cm from the inferior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of area with fibrocystic change located 2 0cm from lateral margin and 4 0cm from inferior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of area with fibrocystic change located 2 0cm from medial margin and 3 0cm from inferior margin  Received fresh  labeled  left breast   is a REMOVED_DATE gram  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm left breast mastectomy partially surfaced by a REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm areola and a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm nipple located 4 0cm from the 6 o clock  inferior  margin as indicated by the stitch and 4 0cm from the medial margin  The specimen is inked as follows  Anterior blue  posterior black and is serially sectioned from superior to inferior to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm firm poorly circumscribed tan  focally hemorrhagic mass located 0 5cm from the nearest anterior margin  0 7cm from the nearest posterior margin  3 6cm from the nearest lateral margin  and 6 0cm from the inferior margin  The mass is 1 5cm superior and lateral to the nearest areolar skin  The remainder of the breast parenchyma appears yellow to white  fibrofatty with focal possible fibrocystic changes  No additional discrete lesions or masses are identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of the mass including nearest anterior and posterior margins  from superior to inferior   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Additional representative section of the mass  no margins    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of lateral margin nearest the mass  taken radially    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of fibrocystic change located 1 0cm from superior margin and 2 0cm from lateral margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of grossly unremarkable breast parenchyma at the inferior margin  taken en face    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of areolar skin to underlying fibrous tissue and adjacent anterior margin  Also received within the same container is an unoriented REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm fragment of grossly unremarkable red to yellow fatty soft tissue which is serially sectioned to reveal a homogeneous cut surface  Representative sections are submitted in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION  1  LYMPH NODE  SENTINEL   LEFT AXILLARY  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  Final Diagnosis by Elena F Brachtel M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE ADDENDUM NOTE  REASON    1 QUANTITATIVE RESULTS OF IMMUNOHISTOCHEMICAL STAINING FOR RECEPTOR PROTEINS Breast  Left  Block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    The tumor cells stain for estrogen receptor protein  The tumor cells do not stain for progesterone receptor protein  The tumor cells show strong  3   overexpression of HER 2 c erbB 2  Note  Estrogen and progesterone receptor quantitation  The percent of immunoreactive nuclei in the tumor cells is assessed visually and reported as follows  The tumor cells stain    10  of nuclei stained  Some tumor cells stain  1 to  10  of nuclei stained  Rare tumor cells stain   1  of nuclei stained  The tumor cells do not stain  0  of nuclei stai